      "caption": "While I love the recording part of putting a piece together, mixing is where the magic happens! I love when we hit on a great mix of words and sound, where the timing is perfect, or you add in a sound element that just brings it all together. This piece will be called \"Sacred Rain\" and includes audio I recorded in Mexico with the rain and birds that inspired me to create this meditation. Thanks again to @stevenblevins_ and @tribesoundrecords always so incredible to work with! \n#soundhealing #soundhealingtherapy #soundhealer #soundhealingmeditation #soundhealersofinstagram #soundbath #soundbathmeditation #mainline #crystalbowls #crystalbowlsoundhealing #crystalbowlsoundbath #crystalbowlsoundmeditation #tibetianbowls #tibetiansingingbowls #tebetiansoundbath #gong #gongbath #gongsoundhealing #gongsoundmeditation #sacredvibrations #spotifyartist #youtubemusic #iheartradio #amazonradio #amazonmusic #itunes #itunesartist #soundcloud #soundcloudartist",
